{"unit_id":"hbgdjb__dsh-session-shield#card-zh","repo":"hbgdjb/dsh-session-shield","commit":"62773898d5bcdf1c2417705fb363f9f01cd30b7f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Session Shield 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话完整性插件。它在全局 llm/stream 流水线上拦截模型输出，并修复可能导致会话记录无法加载的畸形工具调用。插件会补齐空的工具调用 ID 或名称、处理同一流内重复 ID，并把非字符串参数转换成 JSON 文本；正常调用原样透传。适合遇到模型工具调用格式异常、希望会话仍可正常打开的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务，可通过 enabled 配置停用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:81-129","index.js:163-183"]}
{"unit_id":"hbgdjb__dsh-session-shield#card-en","repo":"hbgdjb/dsh-session-shield","commit":"62773898d5bcdf1c2417705fb363f9f01cd30b7f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Session Shield repairs malformed DSH Web tool calls to keep logs loadable. It fills blank IDs and names, replaces duplicates, and converts non-string arguments to JSON. Normal calls pass through. The global stream hook needs no key or external service and can be disabled.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:81-129","index.js:163-183"]}
