{"unit_id":"hbgdjb__dsh-session-shield#feature-1","repo":"hbgdjb/dsh-session-shield","commit":"62773898d5bcdf1c2417705fb363f9f01cd30b7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Shield 的功能「补齐工具调用标识」：流式输出中的工具调用 ID 或名称为空时，插件生成 ID 或使用占位名称；delta 与 block-end 两类片段都会处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:84-119"]}
{"unit_id":"hbgdjb__dsh-session-shield#feature-2","repo":"hbgdjb/dsh-session-shield","commit":"62773898d5bcdf1c2417705fb363f9f01cd30b7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Shield 的功能「规范化参数」：工具调用结束片段的 arguments 若不是字符串，就转成 JSON 字符串；空值或序列化失败时使用空对象文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:65-73","index.js:120-125"]}
{"unit_id":"hbgdjb__dsh-session-shield#feature-3","repo":"hbgdjb/dsh-session-shield","commit":"62773898d5bcdf1c2417705fb363f9f01cd30b7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Shield 的功能「处理重复调用 ID」：同一条模型流中不同工具调用索引复用 ID 时，为冲突调用生成新的 ID，避免重复标识进入后续流。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:44-62","index.js:105-112"]}
{"unit_id":"hbgdjb__dsh-session-shield#feature-4","repo":"hbgdjb/dsh-session-shield","commit":"62773898d5bcdf1c2417705fb363f9f01cd30b7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Shield 的功能「透传正常调用」：插件监听模型流，只在发现需要修复的工具调用片段时浅拷贝并替换字段；其余片段继续原样传递。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:81-103","index.js:140-153"]}
{"unit_id":"hbgdjb__dsh-session-shield#caveat-1","repo":"hbgdjb/dsh-session-shield","commit":"62773898d5bcdf1c2417705fb363f9f01cd30b7f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Session Shield 使用前须知：插件在全局 llm/stream 流水线上运行，配置 enabled=false 可停用该钩子。见 index.js:163-179。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:163-179"]}
